    {
      "gameKey": "quest/042/AktKzh003_04298#TEXT_AKTKZH003_04298_OBSERVERA04298_000_000",
      "en": "May I ask a favor? A colleague of mine from the Thalassai is overdue to make his report, and I need someone to give him a gentle nudge.",
      "hash": "3DEBAC09B7C261E2",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Dis-moi, familier, pourrais-je te demander d'aller chercher un de mes collègues<nbsp>?",
      "ja": "使い魔さん、お願いがあるんだけどいいかな？<br>同僚の観察者を、呼んできてほしいんだ。",
      "frMacro": "Dis-moi, familier, pourrais-je te demander d'aller chercher un de mes collègues<nbsp>?",
      "jaMacro": "使い魔さん、お願いがあるんだけどいいかな？<br>同僚の観察者を、呼んできてほしいんだ。",
      "conversation": "quest/042/AktKzh003_04298",
